      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 157014782888283813, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalEulerAnglesHint.z
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 686428726365587929, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Are you here for that stone or are you here to stop your half-orc friend?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 686428726365587929, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 913915900651289095, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: desiredCamera
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 345978328}
    - target: {fileID: 1560397022146415737, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: ':: (5) - Choice '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1986945429296115731, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Sorry... you're right. I'm after Balbino... the half-orc... I'm sure
        he came this way. Have you by chance crossed paths with him?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1986945429296115731, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 2094339406369811775, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 3378944082295794357, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _id.Value
      value: 23222b9c-5e72-49d8-b5db-f810da6510d5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391700141149575726, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: I guess so... he's on his way to destroy his own stone... his own kin...
        I must warn him.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391700141149575726, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 3477964048685842265, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Well, that as well... but the elven lives are more urgent!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3477964048685842265, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 3533150222167279960, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Very well. I shan't detain you any longer. Good luck.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3533150222167279960, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 3561845551171195242, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.y
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3561845551171195242, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMin.y
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3561845551171195242, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SizeDelta.x
      value: 175
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3561845551171195242, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SizeDelta.y
      value: 20
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3561845551171195242, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3561845551171195242, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -0.33644962
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3562725158728772468, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: It matters not. If your friend destroys the orc stone, it will spell
        the end for the orcs. My question to you, now that you're armed with this
        knowledge, is... does your quest retain its urgency?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3562725158728772468, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: responses.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3562725158728772468, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'responses.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1495669422}
    - target: {fileID: 3562725158728772468, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'responses.Array.data[1]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 343135009}
    - target: {fileID: 3562725158728772468, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'responses.Array.data[2]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 924334563}
    - target: {fileID: 3562725158728772468, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'responses.Array.data[3]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 766072033}
    - target: {fileID: 3562725158728772468, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 3899100222193389752, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: desiredCamera
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 345978328}
    - target: {fileID: 4658210679063694975, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Secret? You mean the Arun stone... the elven stone, right?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4658210679063694975, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 4855632115983247839, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.x
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4855632115983247839, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.y
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5010690279039574094, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Then heed my words. Hidden within the Arun's temple lies said stone.
        But it is not the one you think. The stone of Arun is, in fact, the stone
        of the orcs. It belonged to Molok... the first orc... and Arun's brother.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5010690279039574094, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 5737192680127149077, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 5911866399561705142, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: bgmManager
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1881777936}
    - target: {fileID: 5911866399561705142, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sceneSettings
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 64080260}
    - target: {fileID: 5989535371668987705, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.x
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5989535371668987705, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.y
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5989535371668987705, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMin.x
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6493016781937711399, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: fadeManager
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 301433773}
    - target: {fileID: 6537987846726837934, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lookTarget
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2049736500}
    - target: {fileID: 7126943844283037455, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: '[PREFAB] Talk with Gardener At Arun Garden'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7126943844283037455, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7293188518695655796, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Friend?... Well, I'm here to stop him from making a grave mistake.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7293188518695655796, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 8361152789285272355, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Another visitor... welcome... I know you're not here for the beauty
        of Arun's garden.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8361152789285272355, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
    - target: {fileID: 8444108236132826030, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: bgmManager
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1881777936}
    - target: {fileID: 8444108236132826030, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sceneSettings
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 64080260}
    - target: {fileID: 9032888610789290324, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message
      value: Ah, yes, he passed through 'ere. Too troubled to pay heed to me, he
        has made his way towards the temple, no doubt seeking its secret.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9032888610789290324, guid: 522725deb9587de4ab9db0113c2e0e25, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uIDocumentDialogueWindow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1264133576}
